Native Lua monitor profiles

Create a uniquely named .lua file in this directory, for example Office.lua.
You can save a layout with the Lua-capable nwg-displays and copy the resulting
~/.config/hypr/monitors.lua here under that name.

The monitor-profile menu (SUPER SHIFT E) lists only .lua files. Selecting a
profile copies it over ~/.config/hypr/monitors.lua. The menu does not create
a backup: save your current layout in Git or as another profile first.

Hyprland normally reloads the selected file automatically. If automatic
reload is disabled, reload manually after checking the profile.
